An on/off toggle for a setting that takes effect right away.
[Appica docs](https://appica.dev/ui/components/react/switch)

<%= embed AppicaUI::SwitchPreview, :default %>

## Usage

```ruby
label(class: "flex items-center gap-2.5") do
  Switch(name: "airplane_mode", checked: true)
  plain "Airplane mode"
end
```

A native checkbox with `role="switch"`: it submits with forms and flips with Space, no JavaScript. It renders only
the track - wrap it with its text in a `<label>`. For a choice submitted later with a form (accepting terms), use a
[Checkbox](<%= page_path(:checkbox) %>). Listen for `change` to react to it.

