## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | `:md` | Scales the track and thumb. |
| `checked:` | `Boolean` | - | Initial state. |
| `value:` | `String` | - | Submitted when on. |
| `unchecked_value:` | `String` | - | Submitted when off. |
| `invalid:` | `Boolean` | - | Error state (`aria-invalid`); a Field sets it. |

Other attributes go to the `<input>`, `class:` included (it's the track).

## Accessibility

- `role="switch"` on a checkbox: Space toggles it and it's announced as on/off.
- Wrap it in a `<label>` with its text, or give it `aria_label:`.
- The thumb slide and check are skipped under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
